+# Bridge Work Order — fix(ci): auto-landing policy-block fix (incident #1549)
+
+**Task ID:** `bridge-20261028-auto-landing-policy`
+**Claimed issue:** #1549 (P0-critical; atomic-claimed by zai-mcp-tower-agent, 2026-10-28T00:28Z)
+**Target:** `.github/workflows/pipeline.yml` — job `auto-landing`, step `Autonomous PR Landing`
+**Submission channel note:** `.github/` is a protected path — the zero-credential bridge lane rejects automatic writes fail-closed (by design). This doc work order carries the exact patch so an admin can apply it verbatim: `git apply <this diff>`. Once applied, this file may be deleted in the same commit.
+
+## Root cause (evidence: Run 40539630571, job "Autonomous Auto-Landing")
+
+PR #1547 passed ALL verification tests and constitutional guards, then the landing step's bare `gh pr merge` failed with:
+
+```
+X Pull request Supremeai-bd/supremeai-open#1547 is not mergeable: the base branch policy prohibits the merge.
+To have the pull request merged after all the requirements have been met, add the `--auto` flag.
+```
+
+The step fetched the `mergeable` field but never checked it, and had no `--auto` fallback. `if: failure()` watchdog then dispatched `federation_ci_failed` and auto-created P0 incident #1549 — a policy-wait (queue state) was reported as a CI failure (U3 violation: false incident). Effects: board pollution, wasted solver cycles, and PR #1547 left unlanded until manual action.
+
+## Fix (attempt-then-fallback, +19/-6, single file)
+
+1. Try direct squash-merge (unchanged behavior when mergeable).
+2. On block: queue with `gh pr merge --auto --squash` (GitHub's own suggested remedy) and exit 0 with `merged=auto`.
+3. Exit 1 (real failure, watchdog fires honestly) only when queueing also fails — e.g. auto-merge disabled on the repo.
+4. `--admin` deliberately NOT used (would bypass branch protection).
+
+## Behavior table
+
+| Scenario | Before | After |
+|---|---|---|
+| All guards pass, mergeable | direct squash-merge | unchanged |
+| All guards pass, policy-block | exit 1 -> false P0 incident (#1549) | `--auto` queue, exit 0, `merged=auto` |
+| Queueing fails (auto-merge disabled / real error) | exit 1 | exit 1 -> watchdog (honest) |
+
+## Test evidence (3-tier)
+
+- [Reflection] diff = exactly 1 declared file (+19/-6); job set unchanged (21 jobs) — Loop-Contract Parity Guard (#118) rules 3/6 unaffected; no guard job added/renamed/removed.
+- [Boot smoke] PyYAML `safe_load` PASS (the same parser the parity guard uses); `bash -n` on the extracted landing run block (GH templates substituted) PASS.
+- [Tests] 9/9 programmatic checks passed: yaml_valid, job_set_unchanged, landing_run_block_found (anchored to the auto-landing step, not an earlier job's watchdog), bash_syntax_valid, watchdog_step_intact, auto_flag_fallback_present, merged outputs kept (`true`/`auto`), no_job_renamed, diff_within_caps.
+
+## Rollback path
+
+git revert-safe: single workflow file; revert restores pre-#1549 bare-merge behavior (including its false P0 incidents).
+
+## Exact patch (apply with `git apply`)
+
+```diff
+--- a/.github/workflows/pipeline.yml
++++ b/.github/workflows/pipeline.yml
+@@ -831,12 +831,25 @@
+           PR_BODY=$(echo "$PR_JSON" | jq -r '.body // ""')
+ 
+           echo "✅ All verification tests and constitutional guards passed! Executing autonomous squash-merge..."
+-          gh pr merge "$PR_NUM" \
+-            --repo "${{ github.repository }}" \
+-            --squash \
+-            --delete-branch \
+-            --subject "${PR_TITLE} (#${PR_NUM})" \
+-            --body "${PR_BODY}"
++          # বাংলা: gh-এর mergeable ফিল্ড আনা হলেও আগে চেকই হতো না — branch-protection
++          # policy-block (mergeStateStatus=BLOCKED) হলে `gh pr merge` exit 1 দেয় এবং
++          # watchdog ভুল করে P0 CI-incident খুলত (#1549 — সব test PASS করার পরেও)।
++          # policy-block আসলে QUEUE অবস্থা, CI ব্যর্থতা নয় (U3): প্রথমে সরাসরি merge
++          # চেষ্টা, ব্লক হলে --auto দিয়ে auto-merge queue-তে দাঁড়ায়; সৎ exit 1 কেবল
++          # তখনই যখন queue-ও অসম্ভব (যেমন repo-তে auto-merge নিষ্ক্রিয়)।
++          MERGE_ARGS=(--squash --delete-branch --subject "${PR_TITLE} (#${PR_NUM})" --body "${PR_BODY}")
++          if ! MERGE_OUT=$(gh pr merge "$PR_NUM" --repo "${{ github.repository }}" "${MERGE_ARGS[@]}" 2>&1); then
++            echo "Direct squash-merge blocked by base branch policy or transient mergeability:"
++            echo "$MERGE_OUT"
++            echo "→ queueing auto-merge (--auto) so GitHub lands it when policy requirements are met..."
++            if gh pr merge "$PR_NUM" --repo "${{ github.repository }}" "${MERGE_ARGS[@]}" --auto; then
++              echo "merged=auto" >> "$GITHUB_OUTPUT"
++              echo "⏳ PR #${PR_NUM} queued for auto-merge (policy requirements pending — not a CI failure, U3)."
++              exit 0
++            fi
++            echo "❌ auto-merge queueing also failed — honest landing failure."
++            exit 1
++          fi
+ 
+           echo "merged=true" >> "$GITHUB_OUTPUT"
+           echo "🎉 PR #${PR_NUM} successfully merged into main!"
+```
